The `<package>@<version>` of the purrdf npm release these vendored bytes are. Written
by `make maint-refresh-purrdf-asset` (which always takes the NEWEST release satisfying
the Makefile's PURRDF_NPM_MIN) and digest-pinned by DIGESTS.blake3, so it cannot claim
a version the blob beside it is not. Do not hand-edit. See PROVENANCE.md.
